# Data, models and outputs are never versioned (only their description is).
# Anchored to the repository root: an unanchored "data/" or "models/" would
# also ignore C# source folders such as src/<Project>/Models/ (Git ignores
# case on Windows).
/data/
/models/
*.onnx
*.parquet

# Generated developer documentation
doc/dev/generated/
